name: camod
displayName: "Quantum Realm Mod"
subtitle: "Made by A Nuke | v8"
description: "[#f]Your schemes and saves are prone to corruption. Export your data before updating this mod.[]

An extremely large mod solely dedicated for mindustry roleplaying and builds alike.

Version v8"
author: "
Adrift - Main Dev
Xaoc - Original Mod
T4SC, 4.b1, Hurb - Major help with everything
Molten - Major help with effects and units
HanLarence, petal - Major help with sprites and more
Click, Hurb, Nameless - Minor help with sprites and ideas
Eris - Troubleshooting"
repo: "GMugXD/qr-mod"
minGameVersion: 143
version: 8
hidden: false
dependencies: [
    jqrmod
]

